data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".10** ✓\n- Difference: $1.05 − $0.05 = **$1.00** ✓\n\n## Answer\n\n**The ball costs $0.05 (5 cents).**\n\n*Note: The tempting answer is $0.10, but that would make the bat $1.10,"}    }

